   The various steps of blind startup with CMMA–MMA are il-
lustrated in Fig. 18. CMA–MMA first converges to a constel-
lation with a phase-offset, and then rotates to the right posi-
tion. In this case, the convergence rate to a diagonal solution is
tremendously reduced. In the laboratory experimental work, we
tested CMA–MMA with various channel lengths of 20 ft, 150 ft,
